{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_aprot2_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_aprot2_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "那一场戏",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_aprot2_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "a40ece739f8b4458850b36577051fbb688ee699ebe88e67d26279f82d0f6798c",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "天空的颜色很古怪。\n太阳暗淡无光，云朵染着灰色，天幕从远处开始破碎，裂痕向着中心蔓延。\n但这一切在此时都不再重要。\n你还记得这一天。\n你总是忘不掉这一天。\n这一天好似一个注定会来的预言，早已被所有人知晓。\n这一天又像一个无法摆脱的噩梦，从无一刻停止纠缠。\n你已经分不清这是否是一场戏。\n你的生活，或许从来只是他人眼中的一场戏。\n沉渊。\n你问你自己。\n台上的演员只有剧本，可是你呢？\n你要怎么选择？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "我还是做不到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲伤的男性",
      "text": "沉渊，你不该心软。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲伤的男性",
      "text": "如果不是我搞砸了我们的计划，其他人也不会死。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲伤的男性",
      "text": "现在你还有将功抵过的机会，带我的脑袋回去——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "闭嘴！别让我后悔！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲伤的男性",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "我不该心软......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "......那我该如何？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "我应该现在就杀了你，割下你的头，带回领主面前。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "然后忍辱负重，等待复仇时机......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "不，这不对。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "......拿着这个。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲伤的男性",
      "text": "这是，你的匕首......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "给你，你走吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲伤的男性",
      "text": "可是，沉渊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲伤的男性",
      "text": "放走了我，你要怎么办？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你又一次做出了选择。\n你已经很清楚自己要怎么做了，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "和善的村人",
      "text": "小伙子，多谢你这几天帮着照看孩子们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "和善的村人",
      "text": "几个小崽子都说你讲故事讲得好听咧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "不用谢，老伯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "孩子们都很听话，反而是我们借住在这里，给各位添麻烦了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "和善的村人",
      "text": "不麻烦不麻烦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "和善的村人",
      "text": "哎，那我就不耽搁你们干活了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "给小孩讲故事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "看来你和村里人相处得挺不错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "动动嘴而已，也不费什么功夫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "那也是你有这个耐心，我就不太行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "这几天过得太平静了，任务也没出什么意外，我都不太习惯了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "平静一点也很好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "我倒是希望不要出任何意外......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "你的理想是隐居嘛。我知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "对了，沉渊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "我这有件礼物要给你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "礼物？是什么......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "球形的重物被丢在你的面前。\n微微腐烂的东西落在地上，发出沉闷的声响。\n“礼物”在地上滚动，最终停在你的脚边。\n那双浑浊无光的眼珠与你对视。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "我把这家伙的武器也一起带回来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "这原本是你的，对吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "为......什么......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "被你一时心软放走的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "在你以为自己已经逃离过去的时候，忽然以这种形式出现......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "沉渊，你当时不杀掉他是正确的选择。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "正确的，选择？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "这让这出戏更精彩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "怎么，沉渊，这不正是你为剧团完成的剧本吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "剧本......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "不，不是的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "我已经和剧团没关系了，我早就逃出来了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "这不是剧本！这怎么会是剧本？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "不......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "这是我自己的选择......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲伤的男性",
      "text": "什么选择？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲伤的男性",
      "text": "沉渊，你在说什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "......这是......我自己的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "我没能动手杀了你，这是正确的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲伤的男性",
      "text": "不，不对。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲伤的男性",
      "text": "虽然不知道你在烦恼什么，但杀了我，才是最好的办法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲伤的男性",
      "text": "你不用担太大风险，只要按照安排行事——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "不！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "没有什么安排，你不该死在这个时候！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "快走！我和你一起！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "我们都能逃出去，这次只要小心一点......只要躲起来，不被抓到......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲伤的男性",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲伤的男性",
      "text": "沉渊，你冷静一点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲伤的男性",
      "text": "我跑不掉的。最后还能见到你，已经够了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "你要做什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "住手！停下！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲伤的男性",
      "text": "我不能拖累你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "......骗人的吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不再说话的男性",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "别演了，起来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "快起来！再不走就来不及了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不再说话的男性",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "......你为什么不说话？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲伤的男性",
      "text": "沉渊，我们已经没有别的路可走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲伤的男性",
      "text": "杀了我，把我的脑袋带回去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲伤的男性",
      "text": "你听到了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲伤的男性",
      "text": "快杀了我！我们没有太多时间了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "杀了你？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "像这样，把匕首送入你的心脏，然后看你一点点死去？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲伤的男性",
      "text": "对，没错，就是这样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲伤的男性",
      "text": "沉渊，你的选择是正确的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "是吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "可是......这真的是我的选择吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "哈......哈哈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "你会死，我知道你会死。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "你的头颅注定会离开脖颈，我只希望它不必落在灰尘里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "所以这一次，这一次我会亲手割下你的头。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "头颅",
      "text": "这是你的预言吗，沉渊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "我不会预言，这是我看到的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "我看到你死了。就算我放走你，你还是会死。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "我也逃了，但我终究还是逃不过。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "头颅",
      "text": "你当然逃不掉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "头颅",
      "text": "沉渊，就算你藏得再好，也躲不过那些看着你的眼睛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "......是谁在看着我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "头颅",
      "text": "当然是观众们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "观众......观众？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "我演砸了，他们只会想要除掉我，为什么还要看着我？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "头颅",
      "text": "确实，有人为你在舞台上表现出的心软而感到愤怒，但这也是意料之中的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "头颅",
      "text": "你我都知道，这正是艺术的魅力所在。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "头颅",
      "text": "好的戏剧，好的演员，理应能够调动他人的情绪，不是吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "不......不是这样，不应该是这样！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "放过你是我自己的选择，不是他们的安排！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "头颅",
      "text": "如果你真的能肯定......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "头颅",
      "text": "为什么你还一直走不出这场噩梦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "头颅",
      "text": "为什么你明明已经逃离，却还会反复重现那一天？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "头颅",
      "text": "为什么你要尝试各种可能，要将我从那副身躯上割下，带在身边？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "头颅",
      "text": "沉渊，你在恐惧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "头颅",
      "text": "放过我，是你唯一一次反抗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "头颅",
      "text": "从剧团的手下逃走，花光了你仅有的勇气。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "头颅",
      "text": "“血钻”已经找上门来，你却只能躲藏。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "头颅",
      "text": "一直以来，比起害怕他们追上来，你更害怕这一切都是被操纵的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "头颅",
      "text": "你不喜欢别人的目光落在你身上，因为你在担忧，这里根本就不存在一个“真实的自己”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "头颅",
      "text": "我说对了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "闭上你的嘴。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "你只是我梦中的恶灵，你根本不存在于此！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉渊",
      "text": "不要叫我沉渊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "不要叫我那个名字！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "破碎的头颅",
      "text": "哈哈，可怜的人，你杀不死你的恐惧，你无法让那些疑虑闭嘴！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "破碎的头颅",
      "text": "你知道的，寻找自我是一种禁忌。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "破碎的头颅",
      "text": "但它能成就伟大的艺术！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "破碎的头颅",
      "text": "你仍然在为艺术奉献！他们都错误地评价了你，你是一个杰出的演员！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "闭嘴！我不是在演戏！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我会摆脱你，我会杀死你！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我不会再回任何被安排好的舞台，我早就不是沉渊了，我的一切不是一场戏剧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "破碎的头颅",
      "text": "哦，你的小小决心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "破碎的头颅",
      "text": "那么，我问你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "破碎的头颅",
      "text": "你不是沉渊，你是谁？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我，是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "......落？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "暮落？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暮落",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暮落",
      "text": "我......我在。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暮落",
      "text": "抱歉，我有点走神了......出什么事了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "你发什么呆呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "没什么事，就是我刚刚好像听到你和人说话......结果过来一看，你就站在这发呆。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暮落",
      "text": "......你听错了，这里只有我一个人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暮落",
      "text": "没有其他人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "嗯？那可能是我耳朵出问题了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "对了，■■。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "■■",
      "text": "......你喊我什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "啊？■■啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "怎么了，这不是你的代号吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "哎，不说那些，你看——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "我这有件礼物要给你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "■■",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "■■",
      "text": "礼物？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
